(version 1)
# The mid-mount USB-C's signal pads (C2906290): the maker's layout starts them AT the notch's floor; ours start 0.075 mm
# from it (review 5B R1: at 0.2 mm the leads landed on only 0.3 mm of pad; JLC may ask about copper near the edge). Only J1's / J4's own pads, only to the board edge.
(rule "USB-C pads to their notch"
  (condition "A.Type == 'Pad' && (A.Parent == 'J1' || A.Parent == 'J4')")
  (constraint edge_clearance (min 0.07mm)))
